# --- sxbet capture: LOCAL ONLY, and it is not a policy preference ---------------------
# These four files grow continuously and have already passed GitHub's hard 100 MB per-file
# limit: trades.jsonl 569 MB, orderbook.jsonl 214 MB on 2026-08-21. A push carrying them is
# rejected outright (GH001), which is why data-refresh-2026 sat unpushable. They are untracked
# here so the branch can move; the smaller historical versions remain in git history at
# origin, and the live files remain on disk. Provenance is unverified in any case (D138
# ruling 6). See DATA_AND_OPERATIONS.md.
